<title>NETHERLANDS: Dutch April consumer spending rises 3.7 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Dutch April consumer spending rises 3.7 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>VOORBURG, Netherlands 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch consumer spending rose 3.7 percent in volume terms in April compared with April 1996,, the Central Bureau of Statistics (CBS) said.  </p>
<p> DUTCH CONSUMER SPENDING	   April 1997	March 1997</p>
<p> yr-on-yr pct volume changes</p>
<p> Total consumer spending		  3.7		  2.2</p>
<p>   - food, beverages, tobacco	   3.6		 -0.2</p>
<p>   - durable goods			  3.4		  4.5</p>
<p>   - other goods and services	   3.8		  2.2</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom, +31 20 504 5000</p>
</text>
